For future reference if someone wants to manipulate UDTType (or other deeper parameter options) in Dapper, the best way would be to have whatever object you're using implement the interface SqlMapper.ICustomQueryParameter. 

Doing so will require you to implement `public void AddParameter (IDbCommand command, string name)` 

